OneKey
This product is a modified version of Dopbase (https://github.com/dopbase/dopbase),
forked from release 0.1.8 and rebranded. Changes are recorded in the git history
and summarized in ONEKEY.md of the OneKey repository. OneKey has since evolved independently; its
database and backups are not compatible with Dopbase.

OneKey CLI
The OneKey command-line client, extracted from OneKey (https://github.com/panp1/onekey)
at version 0.7.1. It talks to a OneKey server over its REST API.
